    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Woke Quest</strong> is a satirical turn-based role-playing game that humorously critiques real-life events, personalities, and RPG conventions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four unsuspecting individuals from diverse backgrounds are drawn together by a mysterious force that transcends the boundaries of their reality. Suddenly, a surge of energy engulfs them, transporting them from their computer screens into a realm unlike anything they\u2019ve ever imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emerging from a cosmic rift, they find themselves in a vibrant world brimming with magic, mythical creatures, and breathtaking landscapes straight out of an RPG. It quickly becomes clear that they are far from home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unbeknownst to them, their arrival marks the beginning of an epic saga that will shape the destiny of this enchanted realm and challenge their very understanding of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
